    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 68.064, 235.475, 131.93, 245.334 ],
    "heading level" : 1,
    "font" : "Times New Roman,Bold",
    "font size" : 11.04,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Face Validity"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 15,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 56.64, 148.355, 283.426, 231.111 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 11.04,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Most of the participants in both groups were female (19 females vs. 11 males) with Malay ethnicity (14 Malay vs. 7 Chinese and 9 Indian). Although the participants did not live with their parents, 40.2% of them had at least one living parent."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 16,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 311.81, 299.945, 538.66, 382.701 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 11.04,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Using Paired Samples t-Test, the results showed that the mean score of 6 coping methods including active coping (t=-5.85, P<0.001), using of emotional supports(t=-4.80, P<0.001), using of instrumental support (t=-4.89, P<0.001), positive reframing(t=-3.89, P<0.001), planning(t=-4.91,"
  }, {
    "type" : "list",
    "pdfua_tag" : "L",
    "id" : 17,
    "level" : "2",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 311.81, 154.355, 538.736, 295.341 ],
    "numbering style" : "arabic numbers",
    "number of list items" : 2,
    "list items" : [ {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 311.81, 227.075, 538.736, 295.341 ],
      "font" : "Times New Roman",
      "font size" : 11.04,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "P<0.001) and acceptance (t=-5.98, P<0.001) methods significantly increased after interventional sessions. Meanwhile, the mean score of 3 coping methods including selfdistraction (t=5.43, P<0.001), denial (t = 2.80,",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 311.81, 154.355, 538.469, 222.591 ],
      "font" : "Times New Roman",
      "font size" : 11.04,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "P<0.02) and self-blame (t=7.24, P < 0.001) significantly decreased in post-test. No significant change was found in mean score of substance use, behavior disengagement, venting, humor and religion (p>0.05).",
      "kids" : [ ]
    } ]
